ader__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->1</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following is the correct way to create an array in Python using the array module?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>arr = [1, 2, 3]</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>arr = array.array('i', [1, 2, 3])</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>arr = array('i', [1, 2, 3])</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>arr = {1, 2, 3}</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->2</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What is the output of the following code?</span></p><gfg-tabs data-run-ide=\"false\">\n        <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">Python</gfg-tab>\n        <gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"python3\">\n        <code class=\"language-python3\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">from</span> <span class=\"nn\">array</span> <span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">array</span>\n<span class=\"n\">arr</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'i'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">arr</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n        </gfg-panel>\n    </gfg-tabs><p dir=\"ltr\"><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>0</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>1</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p><span>5</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Error</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->3</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Which of the following methods is used to add an element to the end of an array?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>insert()</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>append()</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>extend()</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>add()</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->4</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What will be the output of the following code?</span></p><gfg-tabs data-run-ide=\"false\">\n        <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">Python</gfg-tab>\n        <gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"python3\">\n        <code class=\"language-python3\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">from</span> <span class=\"nn\">array</span> <span class=\"kn\">import</span> <span class=\"n\">array</span>\n<span class=\"n\">arr</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">array</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"s1\">'i'</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">])</span>\n<span class=\"n\">arr</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">insert</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">arr</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n        </gfg-panel>\n    </gfg-tabs><p><br></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>array('i', [1, 4, 2, 3])</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>array('i', [4, 1, 2, 3])</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>array('i', [1, 2, 3, 4])</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Error</span></p></div></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__9T_0J\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__8owjs\"><p class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__header__questionNumber__GffEN\">Question <!-- -->5</p></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__CzNWr QuizQuestionCard_quizCard_notGfgTabs__q5ycp\"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__quizQuestionTextContainer__question__tv5de\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>What does the index method do in an array?</span></p></div></div><ul class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__4pILJ\"><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionLabel__ZJEuI\"><div><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Returns the last occurrence of a specified value</span></p></div></div></li><li class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__6OtkL false \"><div class=\"QuizQuestionCard_quizCard__optionsList__optionItem__optionInputSecond__Ye4j9 \n                                false\n                            \"></div><div class=\"Qu